# Finance optional skills

- These are Anthropic financial-services adaptations (Apache-2.0): keep headless openpyxl; no Office-JS / Cowork / marketplace.
- Delivery helpers: `excel-author/scripts/recalc.py`, `to_html.py`, `write_provenance.py`.
- Data source order: finance MCP (if configured) → Dexter/FMP/SEC/IR → generic web last resort for public tickers. Never MCP-only refusal when Berkode fallbacks exist.
- Description ≤ 60 chars; reference native Hermes tools (`read_file`, `terminal`, `web_extract`) not bare shell utilities.
- Do not add an in-tree `plugins/financial-services/` product plugin.
- Modeling skills need a capable model floor; do not assume `gemma3:4b` can produce institutional DCFs.
